msgstr "Editor utsöken"

#. i18n: tag string
#. i18n: file ./interfaces/ktexteditor/editorchooser_ui.ui line 42
#: rc.cpp:10
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Please choose the default text editing component that you wish to use in "
"this application. If you choose <B>System Default</B>, the application will "
"honor your changes in the Control Center. All other choices will override "
"that setting."
msgstr ""
"Bitte söök de Standard-Texteditorkomponent ut, de Du in dit Programm bruken "
"wullt. Wenn Du <B>Systeemstandard</B> utsöchst, warrt dat nahmen, wat in't "
"Kuntrullzentrum instellt is; sünst warrt dat bruukt, wat hier instellt is."

#. i18n: tag label
#. i18n: file ./dnssd/kcm_kdnssd.kcfg line 9
#: rc.cpp:14
#, no-c-format
msgid "Additional domains for browsing"
msgstr "Anner Domänen för't Söken"

#. i18n: tag whatsthis
#. i18n: file ./dnssd/kcm_kdnssd.kcfg line 10
#: rc.cpp:18
#, no-c-format
msgid "List of 'wide-area' (non link-local) domains that should be browsed."
msgstr ""
"List vun de \"Grootrebeet\"- (nich link-local-) Domänen, binnen de söcht "
"warrt."

#. i18n: tag label
#. i18n: file ./dnssd/kcm_kdnssd.kcfg line 13
#: rc.cpp:22
#, no-c-format
msgid "Browse local network"
msgstr "Lokaal Nettwark dörsöken"

#. i18n: tag whatsthis
#. i18n: file ./dnssd/kcm_kdnssd.kcfg line 14
#: rc.cpp:26
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If true .local domain will be browsed. It is always link-local, using "
"multicast DNS."
msgstr ""
"Wenn \"true\", warrt de \".local\"-Domään dörsöcht. Disse is jümmers \"link-"
"local\", Multicast-DNS warrt bruukt."

#. i18n: tag label
#. i18n: file ./dnssd/kcm_kdnssd.kcfg line 18
#: rc.cpp:30
#, no-c-format
msgid "Recursive search for domains"
msgstr "Rekursiev na Domänen söken"

#. i18n: tag whatsthis
#. i18n: file ./dnssd/kcm_kdnssd.kcfg line 19
#: rc.cpp:34
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Specifies that every found domain should be in turn queried for more "
"browsing domains."
msgstr ""

#. i18n: tag label
#. i18n: file ./dnssd/kcm_kdnssd.kcfg line 25
#: rc.cpp:38
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Select publishing in LAN (multicast) or WAN (unicast, needs configured DNS "
"server)"
msgstr ""
"Bitte dat Apenmaken in't LAN (Multicast) oder WAN (Unicast, DNS-Server mutt "
"inricht wesen) utsöken"

#. i18n: tag whatsthis
#. i18n: file ./dnssd/kcm_kdnssd.kcfg line 26
#: rc.cpp:42
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Specifies if publishing should be by default link-local using multicast DNS "
"(LAN) or 'wide-area' using normal DNS server (WAN)."
msgstr ""
"Leggt fast, wat dat Apenmaken standardwies \"link-local\" över Multicast-DNS "
"wesen schall (LAN), oder för't \"Grootrebeet\" över en normalen DNS-Server "
"(WAN)."

#. i18n: tag label
#. i18n: file ./dnssd/kcm_kdnssd.kcfg line 34
#: rc.cpp:46
#, no-c-format
msgid "Name of default publishing domain for WAN"
msgstr "Naam vun de Standarddomään för't Apenmaken in't WAN"

#. i18n: tag whatsthis
#. i18n: file ./dnssd/kcm_kdnssd.kcfg line 36
#: rc.cpp:50
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Domain name for publishing using 'wide-area' (normal DNS) ZeroConf. This "
"must match domain specified in /etc/mdnsd.conf. This value is used only if "
"PublishType is set to WAN.\n"
msgstr ""
"Domäännaam för't Apenmaken över Grootrebeet- (normaal DNS-) ZeroConf. Mutt "
"de sülve Domään wesen as in \"/etc/mdnsd.conf\" fastleggt. Disse Weert warrt "
"bloots bruukt, wenn för den Typ vun't Apenmaken \"WAN\" fastleggt is.\n"

